    "innovation": "This paper presents the Factorial Snowpack Model (FSM 1.0), an open-source model with selectable complexity levels for five key processes, enabling systematic factorial experiments with 32 different configurations to evaluate how process representations and their interactions affect performance.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "FSM 1.0",
