            "target_entity_instance": "three-layer snowpack model",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalFeature",
            "paragraph": "The number and thicknesses (Ah) of the layers depends on the depth of the snow: one layer is used if the depth is less than 0.2 m, two layers with a 0.1 m top layer if the depth is between 0.2 and 0.5 m, and three layers with thicknesses 0.1, 0.2 and h\u22120.3 m at the base if the depth exceeds 0.5 m.",
